{"id": "17-996-2-11", "zh": "当格尾 si 在后时，puma 一词的词尾连同格尾替换为 ā 音。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-996-12-17", "zh": "由于规则中取了“anta（词尾）”一词，maghava、yuva 等词的词尾也这样替换。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "17-996-18-19", "zh": "pumā。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-997-2-9", "zh": "“pumantassa（puma 的词尾）”是续用的统辖项。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-998-2-6", "zh": "137. Yosvāno（在 yo 前变为 āno）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-999-2-11", "zh": "当格尾 yo 在后时，puma 的词尾连同格尾替换为 āno。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-999-12-13", "zh": "pumāno。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-1000-2-6", "zh": "138. Amālapanekavacane（呼格单数时变为 aṃ）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-1001-2-9", "zh": "当呼格单数在后时，puma 的词尾连同格尾变为 aṃ。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-1001-10-19", "zh": "he pumaṃ，he pumāno；pumaṃ，pumāno。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-1002-2-12", "zh": "“ā”与“vā（任意）”也续用。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-1003-2-9", "zh": "139. U nāmhi ca（在 nā 前也变为 u）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-1004-2-11", "zh": "当格尾 nā 在后时，puma 的词尾任意替换为 ā 和 u。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-1004-12-21", "zh": "由“ca”一词，在 sa、smā 前，puma、kamma、thāma 的词尾也任意变为 u 音。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "17-1004-22-26", "zh": "pumānā、pumunā，或者 pumena。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-1005-2-9", "zh": "“āne”续用。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-1006-2-7", "zh": "140. Hivibhattimhi ca（在格尾 hi 前也是这样）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-1007-2-10", "zh": "当格尾 hi 在后时，puma 的词尾也替换为 āne。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-1007-11-14", "zh": "取“vibhatti（格尾）”一词，是为了排除“savibhatti（连同格尾）”的续用。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "17-1007-15-17", "zh": "pumānehi、pumānebhi。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-1008-2-11", "zh": "由“ca”一词，yuva、maghava 等词的词尾在所有格尾前任意替换为 āna。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-1008-12-28", "zh": "在“U nāmhi ca”这条规则里，由“ca”一词，当格尾 sa、smā 在后时，puma 的词尾任意变为 u 音。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-1008-29-39", "zh": "依“Jhalato sassa no vā”，sa 变为 no。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-1008-40-44", "zh": "pumuno、pumassa；pumānaṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-1009-2-11", "zh": "“smā”与“nā”续用。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-1010-2-7", "zh": "141. Jhalato ca（在 jha、la 之后也是这样）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-1011-2-8", "zh": "在 jha、la 之后，smā 语尾变为 nā。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-1011-9-13", "zh": "取“ca”一词，是为了在某些情况下不适用本规则。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "17-1011-14-29", "zh": "pumānā、pumunā、pumā、pumasmā、pumamhā；pumānehi、pumānebhi、pumehi、pumebhi；pumuno、pumassa；pumānaṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-1012-2-8", "zh": "142. Āne smiṃmhi vā（在 smiṃ 前任意变为 āne）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-1013-2-11", "zh": "当格尾 smiṃ 在后时，puma 的词尾连同格尾任意替换为 āne。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-1013-12-16", "zh": "pumāne、pume、pumasmiṃ、pumamhi。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-1014-2-8", "zh": "143. Susmimā vā（在 su 前任意变为 ā）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-1015-2-11", "zh": "当 su 在后时，puma 的词尾任意替换为 ā。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-1015-12-14", "zh": "pumāsu、pumesu。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-1016-2-10", "zh": "在 yuva 等词中，这里是“yuva + si”——", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-1017-2-27", "zh": "依“Pumantassā simhi”中取“anta”一词，得 ā 音；又依“Hivibhattimhi ca”这条规则中的“ca”一词，得 āna 替换。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "17-1018-2-25", "zh": "yuvā、yuvāno；yuvānā、yuvā；he yuva、he yuvā、he yuvāna、he yuvānā；bhavanto yuvānā；yuvānaṃ、yuvaṃ；yuvāne、yuve。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-1019-2-21", "zh": "在“Akammantassa ca”这条规则里，由“ca”一词，当 nā 在后时，yuva、maghava 等词的词尾任意变为 ā——这就是变为 ā。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "17-1020-2-43", "zh": "yuvānā、yuvena，或者 yuvānena；yuvānehi、yuvānebhi、yuvehi、yuvebhi；yuvānassa、yuvassa；yuvānānaṃ、yuvānaṃ；yuvānā、yuvānasmā、yuvānamhā；yuvānehi、yuvānebhi、yuvehi、yuvebhi；yuvānassa、yuvassa；yuvānānaṃ、yuvānaṃ；yuvāne、yuvānasmiṃ、yuvānamhi、yuve、yuvamhi、yuvasmiṃ；yuvānesu、yuvāsu、yuvesu。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-1021-2-10", "zh": "同样，maghavā、maghavāno、maghavānā 等，变化与 yuva 一词相同。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-1022-2-4", "zh": "以上是以 a 结尾的词。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-1023-2-7", "zh": "以 ā 结尾的阳性词 sā。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-1024-2-10", "zh": "sā + si，si 脱落，得 sā，意思是狗。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-1025-2-3", "zh": "复数时——", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-1026-2-9", "zh": "144. Agho rassamekavacanayosvapi ca（非 gha 者在单数格尾与 yo 前也变短）。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "17-1027-2-15", "zh": "除了称为 gha 的 ā 音以外，词干末尾的元音在单数格尾以及 yo 在后时变短——这就是变短。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-1027-16-21", "zh": "取“api”一词，是为了排除 si。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "17-1027-22-24", "zh": "其余可依此类推。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-1028-2-43", "zh": "sā tiṭṭhanti（狗站着）；he sa、he sā，he sā；saṃ，se；sena，sāhi、sābhi；sassa、sāya，sānaṃ；sā、sasmā、samhā，sāhi、sābhi；sassa，sānaṃ；se、sasmiṃ、samhi，sāsu。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-1029-2-5", "zh": "同样，paccakkhadhammā、gāṇḍīvadhanvā 等也是这样。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-1030-2-4", "zh": "以上是以 ā 结尾的词。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-1031-2-7", "zh": "以 i 结尾的阳性词 aggi（火）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-1031-8-13", "zh": "生出 si 等语尾，aggi + si，", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-1032-2-14", "zh": "“anto”“simhi”“vā”也续用。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-1033-2-6", "zh": "145. Aggissini（aggi 变为 ini）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-1034-2-11", "zh": "当格尾 si 在后时，aggi 的词尾任意变为 ini。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-1034-12-22", "zh": "依“Sesato lopaṃ gasipi”，si 脱落。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-1034-23-25", "zh": "aggini、aggi。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-1035-2-12", "zh": "复数时，依“Ivaṇṇuvaṇṇā jhalā”得到 jha、la 的名称之后——", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-1036-2-12", "zh": "“jhalato”与“vā”也续用。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-1037-2-9", "zh": "146. Ghapato ca yonaṃ lopo（在 gha、pa 之后，yo 也脱落）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-1038-2-16", "zh": "在称为 gha、pa、表示阴性的 ā 音、i 类元音和 u 类元音之后，以及在称为 jha、la 的元音之后，后接的 yo 语尾任意脱落。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "17-1038-17-18", "zh": "这里的任意是有定的任意（vavatthitavibhāsā）。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "17-1039-2-9", "zh": "147. Yosu katanikāralopesu dīghaṃ（yo 已替换为 ni 或已脱落时变长）。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "17-1040-2-9", "zh": "作为词干末尾的所有短元音，在 yo 已替换为 ni 或已脱落时变长。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-1040-10-16", "zh": "已经替换为 ni 或已经脱落的那些 yo，称为 katanikāralopā。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "17-1040-17-18", "zh": "aggī。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-1041-2-16", "zh": "从“Pañcādīnamattaṃ”这条续用“atta（变为 a）”。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-1042-2-7", "zh": "148. Yosvakatarasso jho（在 yo 前，未经变短的 jha 变为 a）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-1043-2-9", "zh": "当 yo 在后时，未经变短的 jha 变为 a。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-1043-10-11", "zh": "aggayo。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-1044-2-5", "zh": "为什么说“**jha**”？", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-1044-6-7", "zh": "因为有 rattiyo 这样的形式。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-1045-2-3", "zh": "呼格也是这样。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-1045-4-11", "zh": "he aggi；he aggī、he aggayo。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-1046-2-5", "zh": "在第二格单数时，本应发生前一元音脱落——", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-1047-2-9", "zh": "149. Aṃ mo niggahītaṃ jhalapehi（在 jha、la、pa 之后，aṃ 与 m 变为 niggahīta）。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "17-1048-2-14", "zh": "在 jha、la、pa 之后，后接的 aṃ 语尾以及 m 音替换为 niggahīta。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-1048-15-16", "zh": "aggiṃ。", "confidence": 90}
